WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.946
You heard it in a meeting.

00:00:01.966 --> 00:00:03.791
You saw it on your screen.

00:00:03.811 --> 00:00:05.080
Then it was gone.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.332
LokalBot keeps both:

00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:08.773
your calls, and what you saw on screen,

00:00:08.793 --> 00:00:10.020
if you turn it on.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.349
And local AI models,

00:00:11.369 --> 00:00:12.785
like Qwen and Nemotron,

00:00:12.805 --> 00:00:14.778
do the work right on your Mac.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.083
So when you need it?

00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:16.866
Just search.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.155
Quick Recall searches meetings

00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:21.100
and saved screen text at once.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:22.867
Every decision links back

00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:24.377
to the moment it was said.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.614
Search any transcript,

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:27.678
word for word.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.840
Or ask a question,

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.317
and check the sources.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.061
Today shows what still needs you.

00:00:34.081 --> 00:00:36.007
Timeline retraces your day.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.033
And local autocomplete helps you write,

00:00:39.053 --> 00:00:40.312
right where you type.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.726
LokalBot. Free,

00:00:41.746 --> 00:00:44.427
open source, and running on your Mac.
